WEBVTT

00:17:26.338 --> 00:17:30.911
So in that sense the culture
was incredibly strong.

00:17:31.223 --> 00:17:33.253
It was about relentlessness,

00:17:33.277 --> 00:17:36.991
entrepreneurialism, respect,

00:17:37.015 --> 00:17:41.751
tenaciousness, togetherness and community.

00:17:41.775 --> 00:17:45.228
It was really about achieving
a lot as a collective,

00:17:45.903 --> 00:17:48.617
I think that was kind of
the essence of the values,

00:17:48.641 --> 00:17:52.578
and bringing an entrepreneurial approach

00:17:52.602 --> 00:17:54.225
to everything we did.

00:17:54.249 --> 00:17:56.756
And I think the organization,

00:17:56.780 --> 00:17:58.954
you know, for the most part
operated that way.

00:17:58.978 --> 00:18:02.629
I think people felt very emboldened